We have done the first major update since the release of ADT as a Python application!

### Changes

This release contains a variety of changes, including, but not limited to:

- `[+]` Added Arch Linux packaging
- `[+]` Added language concatenation
- `[+]` Added language conversion from text files
- `[+]` Added culture verification
- `[+]` Added version verification tool
- `[+]` Added the `install` hook
- `[*]` ADT can now build itself
- `[*]` General improvements and bug fixes

Review the commit history if you want to get a deep insight about the changes.

### Feedback?

If you have issues with this version, report to us by [making a new issue ticket](https://github.com/Aptivi/tools/issues/new).

